# Validation

Platform-neutral gate:

```text
uv run --locked --managed-python python -B scripts/validate_ci.py
```

Rules:

- Run the gate when the active atom requires validation evidence.
- Do not weaken or patch validators merely to pass.
- Report Catalog-pending failures honestly; do not edit Catalog unless authorized.
- Technical validation is not semantic acceptance or `DONE`.
- See `AGENTS.md` section `VALIDATION_COMMAND`.
